### Proposal Details

The new OID type in the x509 package contains a [function to convert from asn1.ObjectIdentifier to the new OID type](https://cs.opensource.google/go/go/+/refs/tags/go1.27.1:src/crypto/x509/oid.go;l=398). It would be helpful to have a reverse function as well as part of this package. It could look like the following:

```go
func ASN1OIDFromOID(oid x509.OID) asn1.ObjectIdentifier {
	parts := strings.Split(oid.String(), ".")
	result := make(asn1.ObjectIdentifier, len(parts))
	for i, part := range parts {
		component, err := strconv.Atoi(part)
		if err != nil {
			panic(err)
		}
		result[i] = component
	}
	return result
}
```
